[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9423.51, "timestamp": "02:37:03", "text": "哦，天哪，这么多金子。 我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9425.67, "timestamp": "02:37:05", "text": "天啊。 你得到了，你没有，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9428.87, "timestamp": "02:37:08", "text": "运气不好。 你从中发现了那么多黄金。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9430.63, "timestamp": "02:37:10", "text": "我？ 是克里斯。 他真倒霉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9432.389, "timestamp": "02:37:12", "text": "克里斯汀。 是的，克里斯汀找到了那么多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9433.91, "timestamp": "02:37:13", "text": "黄金。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9435.51, "timestamp": "02:37:15", "text": "就像在看一座雕像。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9436.389, "timestamp": "02:37:16", "text": "他会走过来问：“什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9439.11, "timestamp": "02:37:19", "text": "你们在这边发现了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9440.79, "timestamp": "02:37:20", "text": "这个呢？发生了什么事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9442.389, "timestamp": "02:37:22", "text": "你们找到什么好东西了吗？” 克里斯汀打开"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9446.87, "timestamp": "02:37:26", "text": "里面，嗯，就是这样。 里面有55枚金币"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9447.429, "timestamp": "02:37:27", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9449.99, "timestamp": "02:37:29", "text": "嗯，我觉得克里斯彭可能找到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9452.87, "timestamp": "02:37:32", "text": "你错过的那部分黄金。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9456.55, "timestamp": "02:37:36", "text": "哦，那太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9458.389, "timestamp": "02:37:38", "text": "是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9460.71, "timestamp": "02:37:40", "text": "有些讨厌的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9462.389, "timestamp": "02:37:42", "text": "偷钱贼到处乱窜，因为她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9463.59, "timestamp": "02:37:43", "text": "不知道，我觉得她可能都不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9466.23, "timestamp": "02:37:46", "text": "衣柜是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9468.07, "timestamp": "02:37:48", "text": "Lotus或许会，但她不会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9468.87, "timestamp": "02:37:48", "text": "好